# The game's address on the internet: the one place the production domain is
# set. nginx asks Let's Encrypt for its certificate by this name
# (nginx/nginx.conf.template), the deploy workflow checks /api/health there
# after every deploy, and the offsite backup sync connects to it.
#
# Empty until a domain is chosen; scripts/deploy.sh refuses to run while it is
# (AGENTS/HUMAN_TODO.md). Point the domain's A record at the server first.
MATHGAME_DOMAIN=
